song [--options] [url|path]
Acquire and format media for use in media players.
Options:
  --help, -h                     Show this help message
  --output, -o <file>            Output file
  --format, -f <format>          Audio format
  --no-remote, -R                Do not push to remote host
  --remote, -r <url>             Remote host API URL
  --auth, -A <token>             Authentication token
  --form, -F <form>              Name format
  --no-name, -N                  Do not set name
  --artist, -a <artist>          Artist name
  --album, -l <album>            Album name
  --title, -t <title>            Song title
  --genre, -g <genre>            Genre
  --help, -h                     Help Menu